# Generated build state and vendored dependency checkouts are never Nx file
# inputs. The host already excludes them through .gitignore, but the Docker
# image ships without .gitignore, so without this file Nx would snapshot ~71k
# files under build/ and deps/ when a run starts. Task inputs that read
# generated files use `dependentTasksOutputFiles`, which hashes them after the
# producing task has run; a plain `{projectRoot}/build/...` input was hashed
# from the start-of-run snapshot instead, which made the multi-threaded image
# miss its own compile-sources and compile-bindings cache entries.
/build/
/deps/
